<title>SOUTH AFRICA: DataTec still in talks, advises caution.</title>
<headline>DataTec still in talks, advises caution.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>DataTec Ltd said on Tuesday that negotiations were still underway which, if successfully concluded, could have an effect on the price of DataTec's combined units.</p>
<p>DataTec advised unitholders to exercise caution in their dealings until a further announcement.</p>
<p>This cautionary follows an earlier cautionary announcement on May 14.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
